  (The line number moved; re-derive by symbol, not by the number written here.)
- `plugins/sdt-sitter/bootstrap.js:633-646` — `heartbeatTick()`, which computes
  the `elapsedMS` and `sinceProgressMS` the predicate reads.
- `plugins/sdt-sitter/scheduler.js:332-386` — admit, progress tick, heartbeat,
